    "nutrition": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "h_nutrition": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Nutrition, Paused at Its Peak",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "t_nutrition": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The clock starts ticking the moment seafood is harvested. Exposure to oxygen, changing temperatures, and time can gradually affect its flavor, fats, and overall quality.</p><p>Whenever possible, Seatopia seafood is rapidly frozen at the source by our farm partners. From there, an unbroken cold chain protects each harvest on its journey to your freezer.</p><p>This gives you something the traditional fresh counter cannot: control over when you enjoy the fish. Instead of cooking because the seafood is about to expire, you can thaw only what you need, when you need it.</p><p><strong>Peak quality is not rushed to your plate. It waits for you.</strong></p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
