        "t_standard": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Freezing is only as meaningful as the seafood being preserved.</p><p>Seatopia partners with artisan aquaculture farms selected for traceability, responsible production, and continued progress toward ocean-positive practices. Seatopia third-party lab tests every supplier, and then continues to audit them regularly to ensure that they consistently meet their standards.</p><ul><li>Transparent sourcing</li><li>Certified-clean seafood</li><li>Quantified marine nutrition</li><li>Precision freezing and cold-chain protection</li><li>Farming practices working toward healthier oceans</li></ul><p><strong>Because &ldquo;premium&rdquo; should reflect how seafood is raised and handled &mdash; not merely a word printed on a package.</strong></p>",
